# ENTRELUMEN: FTB Chunks shows its map and minimap only to players with the ftbchunks_mapping stage.
# The companion gives that stage to every player outside the Envés and takes it away inside, so the
# dungeon's fog map is the only map there (docs/design/dungeon-enves.md). Everything else keeps FTB
# Chunks' defaults. Server admins may override in <world>/serverconfig/ftbchunks-world.snbt.
#
# Claims are also refused in the Envés and Solsticio. By default any player can claim chunks anywhere,
# and block interaction is then limited to allies, so a non-ally could claim the Envés slot or the
# Solsticio portal and shops and cancel every right-click of the other teams (claims inside the Envés
# also outlive the attempt, so the next team reusing the slot could not light its seals). Neither
# dimension is a place to build a base: both are authored spaces with their own protection.
{
	require_game_stage: true
	claiming: {
		claim_dimension_blacklist: [
			"entrelumen:enves"
			"entrelumen:solsticio"
		]
	}
}
